dhp260:1 starts: A head of gray hairs
dhp260:2 starts: doesn’t mean one’s an elder.
dhp260:3 starts: Advanced in years,
dhp260:4 starts: one’s called an old fool.
dhp262:1 starts: Not by suave conversation
dhp262:2 starts: or lotus-like coloring
dhp262:3 starts: does an envious, miserly cheat
dhp262:4 starts: become an exemplary man.
dhp261:1 starts: But one in whom there is
dhp261:2 starts: restraint,
dhp261:3 starts: his impurities disgorged,
dhp261:4 starts: enlightened.
dhp263:1 starts: But one in whom this is
dhp263:2 starts: up-rooted
dhp263:3 starts: his aversion disgorged,
dhp263:4 starts: intelligent.
dhp264:1 starts: A shaven head
dhp264:2 starts: The liar observing no duties,
dhp264:3 starts: filled with greed & desire:
dhp264:4 starts: what kind of contemplative’s he?
dhp266:1 starts: Begging from others
dhp266:2 starts: doesn’t mean one’s a monk.
dhp266:3 starts: As long as one follows
dhp266:4 starts: one is no monk at all.
dhp267:1 starts: But whoever puts aside
dhp267:2 starts: living the chaste life,
dhp267:3 starts: judiciously
dhp267:4 starts: he’s called a monk.
dhp268:1 starts: Not by silence
dhp268:2 starts: does someone confused
dhp268:3 starts: But whoever–wise,
dhp268:4 starts: taking the excellent–
dhp270:1 starts: Not by harming life
dhp270:2 starts: does one become noble.
dhp270:3 starts: One is termed
dhp270:4 starts: for being
dhp277:1 starts: When you see with discernment,
dhp277:2 starts: ‘All fabrications are inconstant’–
dhp277:3 starts: you grow disenchanted with stress.
dhp277:4 starts: This is the path
dhp278:1 starts: When you see with discernment,
dhp278:2 starts: ‘All fabrications are stressful’–
dhp278:3 starts: you grow disenchanted with stress.
dhp278:4 starts: This is the path
dhp279:1 starts: When you see with discernment,
dhp279:2 starts: ‘All phenomena are not-self’–
dhp279:3 starts: you grow disenchanted with stress.
dhp279:4 starts: This is the path
dhp287:1 starts: That drunk-on-his-sons-&-cattle man,
dhp287:2 starts: all tangled up in the mind:
dhp287:3 starts: death sweeps him away–
dhp287:4 starts: as a great flood,
dhp291:1 starts: He wants his own ease
dhp291:2 starts: by giving others dis-ease.
dhp291:3 starts: Intertwined in the inter-
dhp291:4 starts: from hostility
dhp303:1 starts: The man of conviction
dhp303:2 starts: glory, & wealth:
dhp303:3 starts: wherever he goes
dhp303:4 starts: he is honored.
dhp306:1 starts: He goes to hell,
dhp306:2 starts: as does the one
dhp306:3 starts: Both–low-acting people–
dhp306:4 starts: after death, in the world beyond.
dhp307:1 starts: An ochre robe tied ’round their necks,
dhp307:2 starts: –unrestrained, evil–
dhp307:3 starts: rearise, because of their evil acts,
dhp307:4 starts: in hell.
dhp308:1 starts: Better to eat an iron ball
dhp308:2 starts: –glowing, aflame–
dhp308:3 starts: than that, unprincipled &
dhp308:4 starts: unrestrained,
dhp296:1 starts: They awaken, always wide awake:
dhp296:2 starts: Gotama’s disciples
dhp296:3 starts: whose mindfulness, both day & night,
dhp296:4 starts: is constantly immersed
dhp297:1 starts: They awaken, always wide awake:
dhp297:2 starts: Gotama’s disciples
dhp297:3 starts: whose mindfulness, both day & night,
dhp297:4 starts: is constantly immersed
dhp298:1 starts: They awaken, always wide awake:
dhp298:2 starts: Gotama’s disciples
dhp298:3 starts: whose mindfulness, both day & night,
dhp298:4 starts: is constantly immersed
dhp299:1 starts: They awaken, always wide awake:
dhp299:2 starts: Gotama’s disciples
dhp299:3 starts: whose mindfulness, both day & night,
dhp299:4 starts: is constantly immersed
dhp300:1 starts: They awaken, always wide awake:
dhp300:2 starts: Gotama’s disciples
dhp300:3 starts: whose hearts delight, both day & night,
dhp300:4 starts: in harmlessness.
dhp301:1 starts: They awaken, always wide awake:
dhp301:2 starts: Gotama’s disciples
dhp301:3 starts: whose hearts delight, both day & night,
dhp301:4 starts: in developing the mind.
